#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:52
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Organisations involved in an activity. This filter is not extensive, and "
"only includes Reporting Organisations who have registered with IATI."
msgstr ""
"Las organizaciones que participan en una actividad. Este filtro no es "
"exhaustivo y solo incluye a las organizaciones que presentan informes que "
"han registrado datos en el Registro de la IATI."

# REVIEWED: 8481d5e4fb30a4a9
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:55
