# REVIEWED: 22e99c976ddcbcf1
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:96
msgid "Total Outgoing Commitment"
msgstr "Compromisos salientes totales"

# REVIEWED: f9ada590fc80892d
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:97
msgid ""
"The sum of all outgoing commitment `type transactions "
"<https://iatistandard.org/en/iati-standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
" in an activity. This can be used to filter activities by minimum and/or "
"maximum total Outgoing Commitment."
msgstr ""
"La suma de todos los `tipos de transacciones "
"<https://iatistandard.org/es/iati-standard/203/codelists/transactiontype/>`_"
" que sean compromisos salientes en una actividad. Se puede utilizar para "
"filtrar las actividades por compromiso saliente total mínimo o máximo."

# REVIEWED: 07dcc9b69e444514
#: ../../filter_glossary.rst:100
